    "# Observation : \n",
    "## Tornado plot: \n",
    "The tornado diagrams identify the pre-exponential kinetic factor ($k_{B0}$) as the dominant source of system variance across all methods, while also confirming perfect solver agreement between the sequential and simultaneous approaches.\n",
    "## Fan chart: \n",
    "The temperature probability bands demonstrate that the dynamic controllers aggressively ride the 350 K chance constraint to optimize kinetics, unlike the constant controller which must maintain a highly conservative baseline.\n",
    "## Box plot: \n",
    "The objective distributions highlight the risk-reward trade-off of advanced control, revealing that piecewise strategies unlock a much higher maximum yield potential while concurrently increasing the overall variance of the outcomes. \n"
   ]
